# No Fast models

Fast is forbidden. It spends far more of the allowance than the same model without Fast.

- Do not pass a model slug or parameter that contains `fast`, including `composer-2.5-fast`, `fast=true`, and any "High Fast" variant.
- `grok-4.7-high` launches as High Fast. Do not use it. `grok-4.7-medium` is not a launcher slug. Do not use `inherit` when this chat is on Fast, because the subagent copies it.
- For a subagent, use `composer-2.5`. Do not use `composer-2.5-fast`. Use another slug only when the user names one that is not Fast and the launcher has accepted that exact slug.
- Do not resume a Fast agent to keep working. Stop it. Start the follow-up on a non-fast model.
- Effort and Fast are different. "High" means effort. It does not mean Fast.
